      "id": "claim_1e1aca63880941bbbb157c62afa05aaa",
      "statement": "Mode is a plain Enum with OFF, VIDEO, READING; the module docstring states the two active modes are mutually exclusive because DTLS entertainment streaming must be stopped before REST API control works, and ModeManager exists to enforce the proper shutdown order.",
