      "statement": "AppContext constructs ModeManager with HueBridge, SyncController, EntertainmentStream, the ReadingModeSettings section, and the stored entertainment_config_id, and wires mode_manager.on_video_sync_stopped as the sync controller's set_on_stop_callback, which is the hook that auto-activates reading mode when a video session ends.",
