      "statement": "on_video_sync_stopped acts only when current_mode is VIDEO: it sets the mode to OFF and, if ReadingModeSettings.auto_activate is true, calls switch_to_reading with stored defaults so the lights fade to the reading color; otherwise it merely notifies the mode change to OFF.",
